    "body": "Hi!\r\n\r\n@axeln31459 Yep. I think it's because Triton is now using `mma.884` on Turing GPUs. \r\n\r\n@ptillet I think it's interesting since I'm also using a Turing GPU :). Though ptx doesn't allow `mma.16816` on Turing :(, I can add support for `mma.1688`.",
